menu "WiFi Configuration"

    config WIFI_SSID
        string "WiFi SSID"
        default "Your-WiFi-SSID"
        help
            WiFi network SSID (Service Set Identifier) to connect to.
            Set this via menuconfig or sdkconfig file.

    config WIFI_PASSWORD
        string "WiFi Password"
        default "Your-WiFi-Password"
        help
            WiFi network password.
            WARNING: This value will be stored in sdkconfig file.
            Make sure sdkconfig is in .gitignore to avoid committing credentials.

endmenu

